Package: com.podpod123.gsaport
Name: GSAPort (iOS 8 Experimental)
Version: 2.4.2+ios8.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Experimental iOS 8 build with NSURLSession protocol registration. iCloud sign-in tested on iPad 4 with iOS 8.4.1; App Store sign-in is not covered. After receiving a trusted-device verification code, enter ONLY the code in the password field. SMS verification is not supported.
Maintainer: Pod <pod@podpod123.com>
Author: Pod <pod@podpod123.com>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 8.0), firmware (<< 9.0)
Icon: http://repo.podpod123.com/icons/com.podpod123.gsaport.png
